{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n現年30歲的羅毓儀（Yuki）憑著天生童顏，在TVB節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》中扮演女僕可謂駕輕就熟，更自爆曾因外貌太年輕，在內地拍劇時被誤當成12歲童工照顧，場面搞笑！今次她更升呢「前輩」，在片場親自指導新人，傳授女僕專用的「日文魔法」，究竟當中有何秘訣？\n</p>\n<h2>羅毓儀30歲童顏呃得人 曾被誤當12歲童工</h2>\n<p>羅毓儀入行以來與女僕角色結下不解之緣，她笑言已數不清扮演過多少次女僕。擁有豐富Cosplay經驗及天生童顏的她，即使已30歲，演起少女角色依然毫無違和感。她分享了一件非常搞笑的往事，指早前於橫店拍攝劇集《巾幗梟雄之懸崖》時，竟被內地工作人員誤以為她只有12歲，更將她當成童工般百般照顧，讓她哭笑不得，足證其童顏外貌極具說服力。</p>\n<h2>羅毓儀升呢前輩教新人 拆解女僕專用日文</h2>\n<p>在《愛．回家之三代同糖》中，Yuki與首次拍劇的甄敏芳（Jenny）和穎喬（Ziva）合作。作為「女僕前輩」，她大讚兩位新人表現非常好，更在埋位前與她們齊齊練習講女僕專用的日語。Yuki專業地解釋當中細節：「女僕 Cafe 同普通日本餐廳最唔同嘅地方，就係普通餐廳會講『いらっしゃいませ（歡迎光臨）』，但女僕 Cafe 要歡迎主人返屋企，所以一定會講『お帰りなさいませ（歡迎返嚟）』。因為呢句日文發音比較難，所以我哋有一齊練習。」</p>\n<h2>羅毓儀主動加戲加手勢 盼觀眾更投入</h2>\n<p>除了傳授日文知識，Yuki為了令演出效果更佳，更主動向劇組提供意見。她透露除了跟足劇本唸「日文魔法」對白外，自己亦有主動加入一些手部動作等細節，務求令表演更加生動傳神。她解釋此舉是希望能夠增加互動感，讓劇中的「主人」以及電視機前的觀眾都能更加投入到女僕Cafe的氛圍之中，盡顯其敬業一面：「希望令到主人同觀眾更加投入。」</p>\n<h2>網民大讚羅毓儀專業 「童顏女神好屈機」</h2>\n<p>對於Yuki的童顏趣事及專業表現，網民紛紛留言大讚。不少人表示：「30歲？睇落似20歲咋，童顏女神！」、「原來女僕Cafe講嘅日文唔同，長知識了！Yuki好專業！」、「被誤會係童工單嘢真係好好笑，證明佢真係Keep得好。」、「唔怪得啲動作咁自然，原來Yuki有份設計，好有心機。」、「支持Yuki！又靚又專業，TVB應該俾多啲機會佢！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_5636232246ae957452e394.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_5636232246ae957452e394.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_19020939426ae9575a14489.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_19020939426ae9575a14489.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_15711219866ae9575cdd518.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_15711219866ae9575cdd518.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_5281861116ae9575fb9e52.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_5281861116ae9575fb9e52.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/28_19398430626ae9576323986.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/28_19398430626ae9576323986.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/29_1510033646ae95765c3db4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/29_1510033646ae95765c3db4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/30_7639189796ae957692ea0d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/30_7639189796ae957692ea0d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:56.830236+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1211,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:00:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:38:47.856748+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:55.435624+00:00","content_hash":"d139d7476e30e6d897b5a1c6adaa532c36887ceb28e642e4a9782d51e82a597f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}